    399| def regressor_paths() -> set[str]:
    400|     """The files the regressor TOUCHED, asked of git.  DISCOVERED, NOT NAMED.
    401| 
    402|     A four-element tuple of paths would be a hand list -- the `checks/sweep.py` `LIVE_UNITS`
