    404|     between the regressor and its parent IS the generator's own declaration, and it is one
    405|     subprocess for the whole lane instead of two `git show` per RESOLVED PATH, which is what
    406|     the first live run did: MEASURED, that version spent its time shelling out to `git show`
    407|     for thousands of paths that were never regressed at all."""
    408|     r = subprocess.run(["git", "diff", "--name-only", REGRESSOR + "^", REGRESSOR],
    409|                        cwd=ROOT, capture_output=True, text=True)
    410|     return set(r.stdout.split()) if r.returncode == 0 else set()

